					documentation 	
|
|     * Constructs a new instance of <code>Frame</code> that is 
|     * initially invisible.  The title of the <code>Frame</code>
|     * is empty.
|     * @see Component#setSize
|     * @see Component#setVisible
|     
					
					concurrency 	"Sequential"
					opExportControl 	"Public"
					uid        	0)
