					quid       	"3968B56D01F1"
					documentation 	
|
|     * Creates the Choice's peer.  This peer allows us to change the look
|     * of the Choice without changing its functionality.
|     * @see     java.awt.Toolkit#createChoice(java.awt.Choice)
|     * @see     java.awt.Component#getToolkit()
|     
					
