					quid       	"3968B56E0245"
					documentation 	
|
|     * Gets a Graphics object that will draw to the next page.
|     * The page is sent to the printer when the graphics 
|     * object is disposed.  This graphics object will also implement
|     * the PrintGraphics interface.
