|
|     * Constructs and initializes a point at the specified 
|     * (<i>x</i>,&nbsp;<i>y</i>) location in the coordinate space. 
|     * @param       x   the <i>x</i> coordinate.
|     * @param       y   the <i>y</i> coordinate.
