					documentation 	
|
|     * Constructs either a cyclic or acyclic <code>GradientPaint</code>
|     * object depending on the <code>boolean</code> parameter.
|     * @param x1,&nbsp;y1 coordinates of the first specified
|     * <code>Point</code> in user space
