					documentation 	
|
|     * Returns <code>true</code> if the gradient cycles repeatedly
|     * between the two colors C1 and C2.
|     * @return <code>true</code> if the gradient cycles repeatedly
|     * between the two colors; <code>false</code> otherwise.
