|
|     *  Creates a Raster with the specified SampleModel and DataBuffer.
|     *  The upper left corner of the Raster is given by the location argument.
|     *  If location is null, (0, 0) will be used.
|     
						
						parameters 	(list Parameters
						    (object Parameter "sm"
