						quid       	"3968B5810129"
						documentation 	
|
|     * Filters the information provided in the setPixels method of the
|     * ImageConsumer interface which takes an array of integers.
|     * @see ImageConsumer#setPixels
|     
						
						parameters 	(list Parameters
						    (object Parameter "x"
