						attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
						quid       	"3968B5810132"
						documentation 	
|
|     * Filters the information provided in the imageComplete method of
|     * the ImageConsumer interface.
|     * @see ImageConsumer#imageComplete
|     
						
						parameters 	(list Parameters
