						quid       	"3968B5870298"
						documentation 	
|
|     * Sets all samples for a rectangle of pixels from an int array containing
|     * one sample per array element.
|     * ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException may be thrown if the coordinates are
|     * not in bounds.
