						documentation 	
|
|     * This method returns the <code>Component</code> associated with
|     * this <code>DropTargetContext</code>.
|     * <P>
|     * @return the Component associated with this Context
|     
						
						result     	"Component"
						concurrency 	"Sequential"
						opExportControl 	"Public"
						uid        	0)
