						quid       	"3968B5960185"
						documentation 	
|
|     * Returns a high precision bounding {@link Rectangle2D} that
|     * completely encloses this <code>Area</code>.
|     * @return    the bounding <code>Rectangle2D</code> for the
|     * <code>Area</code>.
