|     * unchanged.
|     * @param delta the value to offset this <code>charIndex</code>
|     * @return a <code>TextHitInfo</code> whose <code>charIndex</code> is
|     * offset by <code>delta</code> from the <code>charIndex</code> of 
|     * this <code>TextHitInfo</code>.
|     
						
