|
|    *   Returns the <code>Font</code> associated with this 
|    *   <code>GlyphVector</code>.
|    *   @returns <code>Font</code> used to create this 
|    *   <code>GlyphVector</code>.
|    *   @see Font
|    
						
						result     	"Font"
						concurrency 	"Sequential"
						opExportControl 	"Public"
						uid        	0)
					    (object Operation "getFontRenderContext"
