						quid       	"3968B59302C1"
						documentation 	
|
|    *   Returns a <code>Shape</code> whose interior corresponds to the
|    *   visual representation of this <code>GlyphVector</code>.
|    *   @return a <code>Shape</code> that is the outline of this
|    *   <code>GlyphVector</code>.
