					quid       	"3968B5A8010D"
					documentation 	
|
|     * Closes this piped stream and releases any system resources 
|     * associated with the stream. 
|     *
|     * @exception  IOException  if an I/O error occurs.
|     
					
					result     	"void"
					exceptions 	"IOException"
					concurrency 	"Sequential"
					opExportControl 	"Public"
					uid        	0))
