|     * @param   v   the value to be tested.
|     * @return  <code>true</code> if the value of the argument is NaN;
|     *          <code>false</code> otherwise.
|     
					
					parameters 	(list Parameters
					    (object Parameter "v"
						type       	"double"))
					result     	"boolean"
