					documentation 	
|
|     * Returns the natural logarithm (base <i>e</i>) of a <code>double</code>
|     * value.
|     *
|     * @param   a   a number greater than <code>0.0</code>.
|     * @return  the value ln&nbsp;<code>a</code>, the natural logarithm of
|     *          <code>a</code>.
