|
|     * Compares this Date to another Object.  If the Object is a Date,
|     * this function behaves like <code>compareTo(Date)</code>.  Otherwise,
|     * it throws a <code>ClassCastException</code> (as Dates are comparable
|     * only to other Dates).
|     *
