						quid       	"3968B5FF02B4"
						documentation 	
|
|     * Creates an output stream with the specified Checksum.
|     * @param out the output stream
|     * @param cksum the checksum
|     
						
						parameters 	(list Parameters
						    (object Parameter "out"
