					quid       	"3968B5B80252"
					documentation 	
|
|     * Returns a BigInteger whose value is equal to that of the specified
|     * long.  This "static factory method" is provided in preference to a
|     * (long) constructor because it allows for reuse of frequently used
|     * BigIntegers. 
