					documentation 	
|
| * <code>RegistryHandler</code> is an interface used internally by the RMI
| * runtime in previous implementation versions.  It should never be accessed
| * by application code.
| *
| * @version 1.5, 09/21/98
| * @author  Ann Wollrath
