|	 * <code>getImportedKeys</code>,  <code>getExportedKeys</code>,
|	 * and <code>getCrossReference</code>.
|	 * <P>For the column <code>UPDATE_RULE</code>, it indicates that
|	 * a primary key may not be updated if it has been imported by
