					documentation 	
|
|     * JDBC 2.0
|     *
|     * Gives a hint as to the direction in which the rows in this result set
|     * will be processed.  The initial value is determined by the statement
|     * that produced the result set.  The fetch direction may be changed
|     * at any time.
