					    (object Attribute
						tool       	"Java"
						name       	"Abstract"
						value      	TRUE))
					quid       	"3968B5D90356"
					documentation 	
|
|     * JDBC 2.0
|     * 
|     * Updates a column with a boolean value.
|     *
|     * The <code>updateXXX</code> methods are used to update column values in the
|     * current row, or the insert row.  The <code>updateXXX</code> methods do not 
