						name       	"Abstract"
						value      	TRUE))
					quid       	"3968B5DA025F"
					documentation 	
| 
|   * Determines the character position at which the specified substring 
|   * <code>searchstr</code> appears in the <code>CLOB</code>.  The search 
|   * begins at position <code>start</code>.
